From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GianlucaFelli <gluca.felli@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 12:33:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/8] Add the Daisugi consensus fork (imported AA-PQ overlay)

Imported verbatim from asanso/AA-PQ a4b1d73b84,
aggregation/frames/consensus/fork/overlays/lighthouse/files (63 files), the
overlay that GianlucaFelli introduced in 3bfba0706b ("Integrate native SPHINCS-G
aggregation for staging review"). It defines the Daisugi fork after Electra for
the live Daisugi chain. The commits after this one adapt it to Nethermind
feature/eip8288-lean.
